# Generated patches and handoff files are local unless explicitly authorized
*.patch
*.diff

# Gate 3 patch evidence is repository-governed audit evidence.
!evidence/gate3/*.patch

# Keep tracked governance and audit documents by default.
# Do not add broad ignores such as *.md, reports/, evidence/, or docs/.
